Package: landisR
Type: Package
Title: Living Biomass Succession Engine Compatible with LANDIS-II Workflows
Version: 0.1.0.9003
Authors@R: person("Yan", "Boulanger", email = "landisR-maintainer@example.invalid", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Experimental R and Rcpp implementation of living-biomass
    succession processes designed for LANDIS-II Biomass Succession
    comparison and independent simulation workflows. The validated beta
    provides deterministic growth and mortality, Ward seed dispersal,
    stochastic establishment, compact state-compressed outputs, LANDIS-II
    input adapters, and direct R-native project construction.
